Method	     Path	                       Token required?	
POST	    /api/auth/register	           No	— (public, self-locks after first admin exists)
POST	    /api/auth/login	               No (rate-limited: 5/min/IP)	— (public)
POST	    /api/auth/refresh	           No — authenticates via refresh cookie instead	—
POST	    /api/auth/logout	           No — refresh cookie optional	—
POST	    /api/auth/me	               Yes	any authenticated user
POST	    /api/users	                   Yes	admin only
PATCH	    /api/users/:id/deactivate	   Yes	admin only
GET	        /api/customers	               Yes	admin, staff
GET	        /api/customers/:id	           Yes	admin, staff
GET	        /api/customers/:id/summary	   Yes	admin only
POST	    /api/customers	               Yes	admin, staff
PUT	        /api/customers/:id	           Yes	admin, staff
GET	        /api/products	               Yes	any authenticated user (no role check)
GET	        /api/products/:id	           Yes	any authenticated user (no role check)
POST	    /api/products	               Yes	admin, staff
PUT	        /api/products/:id	           Yes	admin, staff
DELETE	    /api/products/:id	           Yes	admin only
POST	    /api/products/:id/adjust	   Yes	admin only
POST	    /api/invoices	               Yes	admin, staff
PUT	        /api/invoices/:id/status	   Yes	admin only
